    "Name": "Night Bastion",
    "Details": "The A loadout of the Night Bastion carries a Heavy Gauss Rifle in each side torso and an Ultra AC/5 in each arm. Two Re-engineered Small Lasers are mounted in the head for self-defense against fast moving units, while a Large Re-engineered Laser in the center torso provides some extra damage as needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Gauss</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.29</color></b>",
