  "StockRole": "Stealth Superheavy",
  "YangsThoughts": "When the RISC laboratories developed the superheavy version of the Wraith Suppression Shield System, they wanted to see how it fared in actual combat at a larger scale before they re-geared to their own heavily over-utilized superheavy factories. Three of the Great Houses were persuaded to design a number of superheavy 'Mechs around the system, all three ending up with very similar looks due to the prototype stealth system requirements and pre-designed components supplied by the Republic. Unlike the other two houses, House Davion decided to fit the stealth system into a smaller 150 ton OmniMech chassis, the Night Bastion",
